    <title>Assessment</title>
    <text><list><item>Neovascular (wet) age-related macular degeneration, left eye, with active choroidal neovascularization: active, confirmed [S]</item><item>Nonexudative age-related macular degeneration, right eye, intermediate stage: active, confirmed [S]</item></list></text>

  </section>
